## Why This Is Asked

This question probes practical implementation of policy-driven AI in multi-tenant analytics, including query rewriting, PII handling, budget-aware gating, KB grounding, and end-to-end auditing.

## Key Concepts

- Fine-grained access policies (RLS), prompt hygiene
- Query rewriting to enforce security
- Budget gating and cost controls
- KB grounding with Cognitive Search
- Auditing to Data Lake and PKI isolation

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo function to rewrite a SQL prompt with tenant policy
function rewriteQuery(sql, policy) {
  // append where clause from policy
  const where = `(${policy.whereClause})`;
  return sql.replace(/WHERE/i, where);
}
```

